gpui-material-symbols
Copyright 2026 gpui-material-symbols contributors

This project bundles unmodified Google Material Symbols variable fonts,
codepoint catalogs and SVGs from google/material-design-icons, licensed under
Apache-2.0. The fonts and the packed SVGs are distributed in the data crates
gpui-material-symbols-outlined, -rounded, -sharp and -supplemental (crates/ in
the repository), each with the upstream license as its LICENSE. The upstream
license is also preserved in assets/LICENSE. Exact source revision, sizes and
SHA-256 digests are recorded in assets/manifest.json.

In the repository (not the published crates), the web build of the icon browser
bundles IBM Plex Sans Regular, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(web/fonts/OFL.txt; source and SHA-256 in web/fonts/SOURCES.json).

Material Symbols are a Google design resource. This project is an independent
integration for Longbridge GPUI Kit and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

The web build's repository link draws the GitHub mark from Primer Octicons
19.42.0, licensed under the MIT License
(browser/src/assets/github-mark.LICENSE; source and SHA-256 in
github-mark.SOURCES.json). The GitHub mark is a trademark of GitHub, Inc.,
used under GitHub's logo guidelines to link to this project's repository.
